     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Of him, of her",
     "texto": [
      "For «his» or «her» (of him or of her), the clearest and most usual option is to put **dele** or **dela** after the noun: **o pai dele** (his father), **a mãe dela** (her mother)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The family",
     "texto": [
      "**Os pais** are «the parents» (pai + mãe).",
      "**A mulher** is «the woman» and also «the wife».",
      "Watch the accent: **o avô** is the grandfather and **a avó** the grandmother (with an open «o»).",
      "**Chama-se** = is called. **Quem é?** = who is it?"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
